      "method": "Torch -[getLightRGB]",
      "name": "torch_getlightrgb",
      "pic_base": "0x0105faf4",
      "selectors": {},
      "semantics": "Item-type dispatch over Torch.itemType@64 (cell 0x4b52a4) producing an int (r,g,b) later converted with vcvt.f32.s32 and passed to the Vector ctor. Default (no match) = (253, 150, 55). Table: 0x2f -> (255,255,127); 0xb7 -> (12,100,220); 0x96 / 0xfe / 0x102 -> (300,300,170); 0x94 -> (510,130,130); 0x93 -> (130,510,130); 0x92 -> (130,130,510); 0x91 -> (270,230,510); 0x95 -> (400,510,510); 0x4b -> (220,0,0); 0x4c -> (0,220,0); 0x56 -> (0,0,220); 0x57 -> (135,115,220); 0x58 -> (200,255,255). The 0x4b/0x4c/0x56/0x57/0x58 kinds are exactly the torch types spawned by addToTiles (cross-consistent).",
      "types": "{Vector=[4f]}8@0:4",
      "verified_words": 261
    },
